## Third-party inputs

Redistributed here under their own terms, not the grant above:

| Path | Source |
|---|---|
| `replication/gn/gn_bias_ratings.json` | ground.news pages carrying Media Bias/Fact Check and Ad Fontes Media labels |
| `replication/results/cointet_d3_continuous.csv` | Cointet et al. (2021), HAL halshs-03299024 |
| `replication/data/outlets_evidence_v2.json` | Our coding of ACPM, Pew 2018, Cagé et al. 2022, MBFC, data.gouv.fr; per-field source strings included |
| `replication/results/exp_a/exp_a_gold_430.csv` | Quoted excerpts from 398 French news articles |

`exp_a_gold_430.csv` carries per row one sentence (mean 228 characters) and a
preceding context window (mean 276 characters). The 430 rows are drawn from 398
articles: 370 contribute a single excerpt and 28 contribute between two and four,
where a term occurs more than once in the same article. These are the annotation
units the reported inter-rater agreement is computed over. No article is
reproduced in whole or in substantial part. Copyright remains with the publishers.

